# Build-context hygiene for the web image (deploy/docker-compose.yml builds
# with context ".." = 03_Implement and dockerfile frontend/Dockerfile).
#
# Found by the ADR-0019 compose rehearsal (2026-07-11): without this file,
# "COPY frontend/ ./" overlays the HOST's node_modules onto the image's
# freshly `npm ci`-installed tree. With a pnpm-style host layout the scoped
# packages are symlinks (files), which cannot replace the image's real
# directories -> "cannot replace to directory ... with file" build failure.
# The image build must never depend on host install state.
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/.tmp*
backend/.venv
backend/.ruff_cache
backend/.tmp
**/__pycache__
